1
00:00:00,321 --> 00:00:03,371
You know, they done
f**k with me too long.
あいつら　長いこと俺を　ナメすぎたんだよ

2
00:00:03,391 --> 00:00:05,961
Every time they say my name wrong,
名前を間違えて呼ばれるたびに

3
00:00:05,981 --> 00:00:09,471
it's like they calling me
Cassius. My name Ali.
Cassiusって呼ばれてる気分
俺の名前はAliだ

4
00:00:11,081 --> 00:00:13,991
If I change my name, you
respect that I changed my name.
名前を変えたなら
それを尊重しろよ

5
00:00:14,011 --> 00:00:16,661
It shows you the level of disrespect.
どれだけナメてるかって話だ

6
00:00:16,681 --> 00:00:19,151
Every time they say one
of my outfits are bizarre,
俺の服を毎回
「奇抜」って書くくせに

7
00:00:19,171 --> 00:00:20,791
when the last time
you read a headline
見出しで俺を
「億万長者」って書いてたのを

8
00:00:20,811 --> 00:00:22,491
and they called me a billionaire?
最後に見たのはいつだ？

9
00:00:22,961 --> 00:00:26,321
For three years, Forbes
wouldn't say I was a billionaire.
3年間Forbesは
俺を億万長者と認めなかった

10
00:00:26,341 --> 00:00:29,701
It's all to diminish me,
so y'all wouldn't listen to me.
全部俺を小さく見せて
お前らが耳を貸さないようにするためだ

11
00:00:29,721 --> 00:00:31,931
So, say, when I did the Ye
and Drake show, right?
で、俺とDrakeの
ライブをやった時な

12
00:00:31,951 --> 00:00:35,461
It's so funny, I look up and it say Ye,
笑えるんだけど
見上げたら

13
00:00:35,481 --> 00:00:37,521
D-R-K, right there.
「Ye、D-R-K」って書いてあって

14
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:41,611
But, uh, I just... it's
just a similarity to it.
なんか…
似てるってだけなんだけど

15
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:42,831
Are you dyslexic like me?
俺みたいに
失読症なのか？

16
00:00:42,851 --> 00:00:44,891
Yeah, absolutely. Gemini,
dyslexic, left-handed,
ああ、もちろん　双子座で失読症
左利きなのに

17
00:00:44,911 --> 00:00:46,833
made to be right-handed
so I could fit in.
周りに合わせて右利きにされた

18
00:00:46,853 --> 00:00:48,113
Think about, like, Nike.
Nikeを考えてみろよ

19
00:00:48,133 --> 00:00:50,673
Nike is as popular as Apple,
NikeはAppleと同じくらい人気なのに

20
00:00:50,693 --> 00:00:53,993
but it's company number
321. Apple's number one.
企業ランキングは321位
Appleは1位だ

21
00:00:55,143 --> 00:00:57,823
Nike's on defense. It's not on offense.
Nikeは守りの会社なんだよ
攻めじゃない

22
00:00:58,423 --> 00:01:01,463
Right? Because ni**as love Nike.
だろ？
みんなNikeが大好きだからな

23
00:01:01,883 --> 00:01:04,003
Right? So Nike is used
for political influence,
だからNikeは
政治的な影響力に使われる

24
00:01:04,023 --> 00:01:06,583
because it's not about
the money you make.
稼ぐ金じゃなくて

25
00:01:06,603 --> 00:01:08,363
It's about the position you have.
どんな立場にいるかが大事なんだ

26
00:01:08,383 --> 00:01:12,183
So when they signed me to Gap,
it wasn't to raise a stock price.
だからGapが俺と契約したのも
株価を上げるためじゃない

27
00:01:12,203 --> 00:01:14,303
It was to be able to, like,
中国と取引してる

28
00:01:14,323 --> 00:01:18,233
tell the Fortune 500 companies
that do deals with China,
Fortune 500の企業に
「Gapは低所得層の地域に

29
00:01:18,253 --> 00:01:23,663
to tell them, hey, Gap has influence
in the underserved communities.
影響力がある」って
示すためだった

30
00:01:24,373 --> 00:01:26,233
That was what the deal was about.
あの契約は
そういうことだったんだよ
